7,"stem":588,"description":589,"children":-1},"Command Flags","\u002Fgetting-started\u002Freference\u002Fflags","1.getting-started\u002F7.reference\u002Fflags","FiveNet command line interface (CLI) supports several flags that can be used to modify the behavior of the application when running various commands. Below is a comprehensive list of available flags and their descriptions.",1789078706729]